		line=410,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Two years since our fateful August uprising─",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Today is a day that will go down in the Empire's history.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"The inauguration of its first president, Elsa Valentine.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"The ceremony is being conducted with all the pomp and circumstance befitting the momentous occasion.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“My fellow Imperials. I stand before you honored and humbled by the trust you've bestowed upon me in electing me as your president.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"All eyes on her at the podium, Elsa delivers her speech.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"She is forced to pause regularly by outpours of applause and praise from the audience.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Ever since Warren's repatriation, Elsa has worked tirelessly as Empress Hisui's political advisor to introduce democracy to the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Her sudden reforms were met with no small amount of skepticism and opposition.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"But at every step along the way, Kanami and Kotone offered their support in winning over the Imperials who were still distrustful of her.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"With the Empress and the Exalt-Priestess at her back, little by little, the Imperial people began to accept Elsa's new system.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Of course, it goes without saying that she herself worked hardest of all to turn her vision into reality.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"She tirelessly traveled all across the country to extol the value and significance of democracy, hardly ever getting a full night's sleep.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"At the same time, she devoted every spare moment to studying Imperial history and culture, seeking to integrate herself fully into her new nationality.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"All of her earnest efforts were what led Elsa to stand at this podium today.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"However, it's safe to say that her real battle has only just begun.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"The introduction of democracy was never her ultimate objective...",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"About three months ago─",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"The prospects for our reforms looking brighter than ever, Elsa and I allow ourselves to indulge in a brief sigh of relief.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin? What would you say if I told you I wanted to run for president?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's see... I think I'd ask your reasons why over a cup of tea.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"True to my word, I brew a cup of tea and set it down in in front of her.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Elsa only started drinking green tea because it was “the Imperial way,” but as of late, she's come around to liking it more than the black tea she's accustomed to.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"After taking a sip of her tea, she turns to face me.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I was planning to retire from politics after the election was held, but I've started to realize that I'm a lot more ambitious than I once thought.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's not the nicest way of putting it, but as of now, the Empire only has its independence because the Republic is choosing to letting it slide.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And there's no guarantee that they won't change their minds in the future.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I hear the Republic hasn't changed its expansionist ways.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right. If we want the Empire to have a long future, we'll need some way to stand up to them.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"─But how?",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Such a question must have passed through the lips of many across the world trampled beneath the Republic's boot.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Yet Elsa merely continues sipping her tea with a calm expression on her face.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds like you have a concrete plan in mind.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hard power can only be opposed by hard power.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We stand no chance against the Republic if it comes down to war.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, but we have magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If we fuse our magicks with Republican technologies, we can create powerful weapons indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Remember the gun I used to shoot down those bombs in Yogarasu District?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"The day Yogarasu District was bombed, Elsa's gun allowed her to intercept the falling bombs with ease.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"The bullets she fired seemed to have a will of their own, taking wildly impossible trajectories to search out and destroy their targets.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We can apply that same technology in order to build a bomb.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If we can build a bomb like that which leaves nothing to chance, the Republic will have a hard time ever laying their hands on the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“From their point of view, it'll be like having a blade at your neck at every moment.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So you intend to stand up to the Republic not with the quantity of our weapons, but their quality?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Exactly.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I want to become president in order to make this idea a reality.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Hers is a grand project, one that can't be realized without all the resources of the Empire at her disposal.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"And for that, she needs to become a leader capable of rallying all the Imperial people behind her banner.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, you should absolutely run for president.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're the only one who could pull it off.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, thank you. That's my fiancé for you.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Elsa snaps one eye playfully shut.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"I only learned this recently, but apparently what she's doing is called a ≪wink.≫",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Now I know I can run for president without any reservations.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Think you can win?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No matter how much the odds are stacked against me, my mind is already made up.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If I happen to lose, I'll just run again.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What a lovely fiancée I have.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She's practically wasted on someone like me.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Gosh, why do you always have to say stuff like that?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Elsa sets down her teacup and plops down into my lap.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Are you worried about me running for president?”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not in the slightest.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"I wrap an arm around her waist.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If anything, it makes me all the more excited for what the future has in store.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ehehee, that's more like it.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Her tender lips grace my own with a kiss.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Two months later, millions of Imperial citizens made their way to the ballot box for the very first time.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Elsa was elected to the presidency in a landslide victory.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"After finishing her inaugural address, I step onto the stage by her side.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"In the Republic, it's apparently not just commonplace, but expected for family members of politicians to make public appearances like this.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't be shy, now.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you embarrass yourself here, Miyaguni-san will definitely let you hear about it afterwards!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, don't I know it.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Akari has already given our engagement her blessing.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Of course, I haven't stopped being Akari's vassal even if I'm going to be marrying Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I will continue to serve as my lord's blade.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Incidentally, Akari expressed great interest in running for the upcoming parliamentary election.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"She did say that she wasn't particularly attached to the throne.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"It seems she is content to lead the country towards a brighter future as a citizen of the Empire like any other.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Kanami has already relinquished almost all of her political powers and currently lives a modest life in the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Even so, her popularity among the people hasn't waned in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"She still makes regular public appearances, such as during New Year's celebrations or the Armistice Day ceremony, and is met with raucous cheers each time.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"The Empress really is just that revered by the people.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Under the new political order, the warriors have been assigned the task of maintaining public order as a special division of the Imperial Police.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Naturally, Hotori serves as their captain.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"As Hotori's lieutenant, I spend my days and nights running all around Tenkyo alongside her.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"No matter how the Empire changes, our duty to protect these lands is unyielding.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Kotone continues to administer the Tento faith as its Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"For the past two years, she's worked to restore the Barrier in preparation for a potential Republican invasion.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"With Elsa as president, they will be working closely together to develop weapons capable of combining Imperial magicks with Republican technologies.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Will you always stay by my side?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, of course I will.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"From this day forward, Elsa will stand at the vanguard as she leads the Empire towards a new age of peace.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"There are sure to be many trials and tribulations lying in store for her.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Even the ever-dependable Elsa is sure to have times when she feels faint of heart.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"But when those times come, I'll be there for her.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's walk this path together. Forevermore.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Yes, let's.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Following Elsa's lead, I raise my hand and wave to the people.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"A deafening cheer rises up from the crowd.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"With the people's blessing, we take our very first steps on this new journey.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"May we protect this Empire of ours.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Today, and tomorrow─",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"─and for ages more.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
